    <title>
        <en>DT-75</en>
        <de>DT-75</de>
        <ru>ДТ-75</ru>
    </title>
    <description>
        <en><![CDATA[
   The universal caterpillar tractor of the 3rd traction class, manufactured at the Volgograd Tractor Plant, is aggregated with various equipment and linkages.]]></en>
        <de><![CDATA[
   Der im Wolgograder Traktorenwerk hergestellte Universal-Raupentraktor der 3. Traktionsklasse ist mit verschiedenen Geräten und Gestängen zusammengefasst.]]></de>
        <ru><![CDATA[
   Универсальный гусеничный трактор 3 тягового класса, производившийся на Волгоградском Тракторном Заводе, агрегатируется с различными вариациями оборудования и навесками.]]></ru>
    </description>
    <iconFilename>store/icon_DT_75.dds</iconFilename>
    <multiplayer supported="true"/>
    <newcategory name="vgtz" title="ДТ Пак" type="VEHICLE" img="store/storeDT_75.dds"/>
    <extraSourceFiles>
        <sourceFile filename="scripts/categorizer.lua"/>
    </extraSourceFiles>
    <specializations>
        <specialization name="moreDesignConfigs" className="MoreDesignConfigs" filename="scripts/MoreDesignConfigs.lua"/>
    </specializations>
    <vehicleTypes>
        <type name="dt" parent="tractor" className="Vehicle" filename="$dataS/scripts/vehicles/Vehicle.lua">
            <specialization name="moreDesignConfigs"/>
			<specialization name="powerConsumer"/>
            <specialization name="turnOnVehicle" />
        </type>
        <type name="pnd250" parent="shovel" className="Vehicle" filename="$dataS/scripts/vehicles/Vehicle.lua">
            <specialization name="turnOnVehicle" />
			<specialization name="conveyorBelt" />
            <specialization name="moreDesignConfigs"/>
        </type>
    </vehicleTypes>
    <storeItems>
        <storeItem xmlFilename="DT_75.xml"/>
        <storeItem xmlFilename="tools/PND_250.xml"/>
